<title>UK: Ingersoll-Rand says has 3.8 pct interest in Newman.</title>
<headline>Ingersoll-Rand says has 3.8 pct interest in Newman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ingersoll-Rand Co said on Tuesday its subsidiary NT Acquisition Ltd, had bought 4.9 million shares in Newman Tonks Group Plc, representing 3.82 percent of the British building products group's issued share capital.</p>
<p>On January 27 Ingersoll-Rand made a recommended cash offer for Newman Tonks, valuing it at around 230 million stg.</p>
<p>Newman Tonks is fighting a hostile bid from British engineering group FKI PLC.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
